Package: com.kainograze.ipresence
Name: iPresence
Version: 2.0.0~rootless1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Music presence for Discord on rootless iOS 15-26.0.1
 Includes the settings app, background daemon and SpringBoard media helper.
 Device validation is required for each supported jailbreak and OS combination.
